                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-08-11T01:04:01.936-07:00"
                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="admin"
                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                    sling:resourceType="wcm/foundation/components/text"
                    text="&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;>&lt;b style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>(For Temp Faculty, Graduate Assistants, Teaching Associates, and Instructional Student Assistants)&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&lt;b style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>When to Use This Process&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>The Faculty Action Request (FAR) form is to be used in the event an appointment correction, cancellation, or action/reason code correction is necessary for an existing temporary faculty, graduate assistant, teaching associate, or instructional student assistant.&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>&lt;b>Steps for Completing the Faculty Action Request (FAR) Form&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;ul class=&quot;px-6&quot;>&#xa;&lt;li>Fill in the blanks on the FAR form. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>Complete current lines and only complete new/changed lines if making a correction to a current appointment. This does not apply to Short Work Break submittals.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>Please use the REMARKS field on the form to make notes about the reason for the transaction request (required).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>Workflow Process includes: Preparer submits the form, Optional Reviewer Approves, Academic HR Services Reviews, Chair Approval, Dean Approval, Academic HR Approval, and Payroll approval.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot;>&lt;b>Things to Keep in Mind&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xa;&lt;li>If changing a Grade/Range due to a terminal degree, please note in remarks as well as send a copy of the original transcript with the form.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>If form is rejected, the preparer will be notified of a rejected reason.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;li>For Short Work Break (SWB) submittals, indicate the term the faculty will be on SWB in the remarks field.&lt;/li>&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot;>&lt;b>Questions…&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;px-4&quot;>Should you have any questions regarding the appointment of temporary faculty, graduate assistants, teaching associates, or instructional student assistants,&amp;nbsp;please contact Academic HR Services at &lt;b>&lt;u>academichr@fullerton.edu&lt;/u>&lt;/b>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xa;"
                    textIsRich="true">
